{"leftColumnItems":[{"text":"城邦改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/citystates/cse_agricultural/CIVILIZATION_CSD_YANGON.html\">仰光</a>：效果修改为淡水农田与种植园1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/citystates/cse_agricultural/CIVILIZATION_CSD_FERGANA.html\">费尔干纳</a>：余粮百分比效果移除。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/citystates/cse_maritime/CIVILIZATION_CSD_ALGIERS.html\">阿尔及尔</a>：效果修改为海岸扫荡+100<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"区域&建筑改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_CITY_CENTER/BUILDING_MONUMENT.html\">纪念碑</a>：历法1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值还原。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_CITY_CENTER/BUILDING_NILOMETER_HD.html\">测量仪</a>：特效还原为2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_CITY_CENTER/BUILDING_TRIUMPHAL_ARCH.html\">凯旋门</a>：特效还原为2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_AQUEDUCT/BUILDING_JNR_ORCHARD.html\">果园</a>：现提供余粮加成5%。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_AQUEDUCT/BUILDING_JNR_HAMMER_WORKS.html\">水力锻锤</a>：现提供余粮加成5%。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_AQUEDUCT/BUILDING_JNR_BATHHOUSE.html\">浴场</a>：现提供余粮加成5%。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_INDUSTRIAL_ZONE/BUILDING_FACTORY.html\">工厂</a>：建造花费改回360<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_INDUSTRIAL_ZONE/BUILDING_JNR_CHEMICAL.html\">化工厂</a>：建造花费改回360<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_CAMPUS/BUILDING_JNR_LABORATORY.html\">实验室</a>：还原为每人口0.5<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_CAMPUS/BUILDING_JNR_REAL_ACADEMY.html\">研究院</a>：建造花费还原为500<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_CAMPUS/BUILDING_JNR_ARCHITECTURE.html\">建筑学院</a>：建造花费还原为500<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_CAMPUS/BUILDING_JNR_LIBERAL_ARTS.html\">文艺学院</a>：建造花费还原为420<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_THEATER/BUILDING_JNR_CABINET.html\">陈列室</a>：建造花费还原为180<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_THEATER/BUILDING_JNR_MANSION.html\">官学</a>：建造花费还原为180<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_THEATER/BUILDING_JNR_OPERA.html\">歌剧院</a>：建造花费还原为330<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_THEATER/BUILDING_JNR_GRAND_HOTEL.html\">大酒店</a>：建造花费还原为330<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_THEATER/BUILDING_MUSEUM_ART.html\">艺术博物馆</a>：建造花费还原为180<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_THEATER/BUILDING_MUSEUM_ARTIFACT.html\">考古博物馆</a>：建造花费还原为180<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_COMMERCIAL_HUB/BUILDING_BANK.html\">银行</a>：建造花费还原为275<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_COMMERCIAL_HUB/BUILDING_JNR_MERCHANT_QUARTER.html\">商人中心</a>：建造花费还原为275<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_COMMERCIAL_HUB/BUILDING_STOCK_EXCHANGE.html\">证券交易所</a>：建造花费还原为550<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_COMMERCIAL_HUB/BUILDING_JNR_MARKETING_AGENCY.html\">市场部</a>：建造花费还原为520<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_HARBOR/BUILDING_SHIPYARD.html\">造船厂</a>：建造花费还原为220<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_HARBOR/BUILDING_JNR_HAVEN.html\">军港</a>：建造花费还原为200<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_HARBOR/BUILDING_JNR_FREEPORT.html\">商港</a>：建造花费还原为220<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_HARBOR/BUILDING_SEAPORT.html\">海港</a>：建造花费还原为400<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_HARBOR/BUILDING_JNR_CRUISE_TERMINAL.html\">游轮码头</a>：建造花费还原为400<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_HARBOR/BUILDING_JNR_NAVAL_BASE.html\">海军基地</a>：建造花费还原为320<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_INDUSTRIAL_ZONE/BUILDING_WORKSHOP.html\">工作坊</a>：修复基础值为3<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"奇观改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/BUILDING_ESTADIO_DO_MARACANA.html\">马拉卡纳体育场</a>：现在基础产出和特效加成统一为9环。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/BUILDING_MEENAKSHI_TEMPLE.html\">米纳克希神庙</a>：(开启区域扩展时)移除圣地三级建筑对周围单元格的<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物加成。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/BUILDING_APADANA.html\">阿帕达纳宫</a>：宗主每城邦的<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值由2回调至1。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/BUILDING_KILWA_KISIWANI.html\">基尔瓦基斯瓦尼</a>：建成时获得的额外<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_ENVOY.png\" alt=\"ICON_ENVOY\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>使者由3回调至5。宗主1/2个某种城邦获得的对应产出由10%/10%回调至15%/15%。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/BUILDING_NOTRE_DAME.html\">圣母院</a>：9环辐射产出由1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_AMENITIES.png\" alt=\"ICON_AMENITIES\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>宜居度2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰调整至1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_AMENITIES.png\" alt=\"ICON_AMENITIES\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>宜居度2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/BUILDING_SUK_WAT_ARUN.html\">郑王庙</a>：恢复本体产出5影响力点数。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/wonders/wonders/BUILDING_ORSZAGHAZ.html\">匈牙利议会大厦</a>：额外影响力加成由50%回调至100%。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"伟人改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/greatpeople/GREAT_PERSON_CLASS_MERCHANT/GREAT_PERSON_INDIVIDUAL_JOHN_SPILSBURY.html\">约翰·斯皮斯伯里</a>：在该单元格上创建一个玩具公司，最多可以进口5种玩具产品。公司效果为：拥有商业中心的城市每位<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CITIZEN.png\" alt=\"ICON_CITIZEN\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>市民+0.6<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值。拥有港口的城市每位<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CITIZEN.png\" alt=\"ICON_CITIZEN\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>市民+0.6<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/greatpeople/GREAT_PERSON_CLASS_MERCHANT/GREAT_PERSON_INDIVIDUAL_HELENA_RUBINSTEIN.html\">海伦娜·鲁宾斯坦</a>：在该单元格上创建一个化妆品公司，最多可以进口5种化妆品。公司效果为：所有城市已改良的地块+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值、+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。所有改良设施由<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值或<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力提供的<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_TOURISM.png\" alt=\"ICON_TOURISM\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>旅游业绩+50%。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/greatpeople/GREAT_PERSON_CLASS_MERCHANT/GREAT_PERSON_INDIVIDUAL_LEVI_STRAUSS.html\">李维·史特劳斯</a>：在该单元格上创建一个牛仔裤公司，最多可以进口5种牛仔裤产品。公司效果为：购买摇滚乐队的费用降低50%，忽略地形、地貌、河流、上船和下船的额外<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_MOVEMENT.png\" alt=\"ICON_MOVEMENT\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>移动力消耗。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/greatpeople/GREAT_PERSON_CLASS_MERCHANT/GREAT_PERSON_INDIVIDUAL_ESTEE_LAUDER.html\">雅诗兰黛</a>：在该单元格上创建一个香水公司，最多可以进口5种香水产品。公司效果为：所有城市已改良的地块+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值、+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰。所有改良设施由<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值或<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰提供的<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_TOURISM.png\" alt=\"ICON_TOURISM\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>旅游业绩+100%。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"科技&市政改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civics/ERA_MEDIEVAL/CIVIC_FEUDALISM.html\">封建主义</a>：新增学院二级建筑为学院提供雨林的标准相邻加成。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/technologies/ERA_INDUSTRIAL/TECH_CIVIL_ENGINEERING_HD.html\">土木工程</a>：移除<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/technologies/ERA_RENAISSANCE/TECH_MILITARY_TACTICS.html\">战术</a>前置。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/technologies/ERA_CLASSICAL/TECH_SHIPBUILDING.html\">造船术</a> 解锁甘榜屋建造在海藻森林上的能力。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"政体&政策改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governments/legacy/POLICY_GOV_MONARCHY.html\">君主传承</a>：驻军城市额外5%人口增长速度回调至10%。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governments/legacy/POLICY_GOV_THEOCRACY.html\">神权传承</a>：每人口产出1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰的前置由<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/districts/common/DISTRICT_HOLY_SITE.html\">圣地</a>二级建筑修改为<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/districts/common/DISTRICT_HOLY_SITE.html\">圣地</a>。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governments/economic/POLICY_RATIONALISM.html\">理性主义</a>：人口<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值由0.2/0.4回调至0.3/0.5。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governments/economic/POLICY_GRAND_OPERA.html\">教育学</a>：人口<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值由0.2/0.4回调至0.3/0.5。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governments/diplomatic/POLICY_RAJ.html\">统治</a>：宗主每个城邦<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值/<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值由1/1回调至2/2。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governments/diplomatic/POLICY_COLONIAL_TAXES.html\">殖民地税收</a>：外大陆城市加成<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币/<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力由15%/5%回调至25%/10%。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governments/darkage/POLICY_ROBBER_BARONS.html\">敛财大亨</a>：<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_INDUSTRIAL_ZONE/BUILDING_FACTORY.html\">工厂</a>和<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/buildings/DISTRICT_COMMERCIAL_HUB/BUILDING_STOCK_EXCHANGE.html\">证券交易所</a> 加成分别由25%<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币和15%<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力回调至50%<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币和25%<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。并适配区域扩展。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governments/darkage/POLICY_MONASTICISM.html\">修行制度</a>：有<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/districts/common/DISTRICT_HOLY_SITE.html\">圣地</a>的城市额外<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值由50%回调至75%。</li><li>恢复外交卡 <a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governments/diplomatic/POLICY_SCIENTIFIC_EXPEDITIONS.html\">科学考察队</a>。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"信条改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/FOLLOWER/BELIEF_JESUIT_EDUCATION.html\">耶稣会教育</a>：每级圣地建筑提供的人口瓶修改为0.5。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/FOLLOWER/BELIEF_CHORAL_MUSIC.html\">合唱圣歌</a>：回调每个信徒增加百分比文化。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/FOLLOWER/BELIEF_FEED_THE_WORLD.html\">哺育世界</a>：回调每个信徒增加百分比粮食。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/FOLLOWER/BELIEF_RELIQUARIES.html\">圣物箱</a>：圣地建筑不再产出旅游业绩。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/FOLLOWER/BELIEF_ABBOT.html\">苦行</a>：回调圣地地基+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/PANTHEON/BELIEF_ONE_WITH_NATURE.html\">天人合一</a>：全产百分比从5%回调为10%。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/PANTHEON/BELIEF_GODDESS_OF_FESTIVALS.html\">节庆女神</a>、<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/PANTHEON/BELIEF_TENGRI.html\">长生天</a>对应改良<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/units/CIVILIAN/UNIT_GREAT_PROPHET.html\">大预言家</a>点数由+1回调为+2，<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/districts/common/DISTRICT_HOLY_SITE.html\">圣地</a>相邻加成由+2调整为+1。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/FOUNDER/BELIEF_LAY_MINISTRY.html\">民间宗教团</a>：从每个信奉该宗教的城市+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值回调为+3<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/FOUNDER/BELIEF_STEWARDSHIP.html\">管理工作</a>：从每个信奉该宗教的城市+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值回调为+3<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/FOUNDER/BELIEF_WORLD_CHURCH.html\">普世教会</a>：从该宗教每3个信徒则+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值回调为每2个信徒。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/FOUNDER/BELIEF_CROSS_CULTURAL_DIALOGUE.html\">跨文化对话</a>：从该宗教每3个信徒则+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值回调为每2个信徒。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/FOUNDER/BELIEF_PAPAL_PRIMACY.html\">教皇权威</a>：移回征兵费用减少20%。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/religions/FOLLOWER/BELIEF_DIVINE_INSPIRATION.html\">神灵的启示</a>：世界奇观+5<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰回调为+4<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰。完成世界奇观后返还等同于奇观所需产能25%<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FAITH.png\" alt=\"ICON_FAITH\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>信仰回调为33%。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"改良改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li>新增<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/improvements/common/IMPROVEMENT_CAMP.html\">营地</a>在公会后+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li>新增<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/improvements/common/IMPROVEMENT_PASTURE.html\">牧场</a>在中世纪集市后+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li>调整了科技市政树上的文本提示。</li><li>回调<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/improvements/common/IMPROVEMENT_PLANTATION.html\">种植园</a>在<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/civics/ERA_MEDIEVAL/CIVIC_MEDIEVAL_FAIRES.html\">中世纪集市</a>后+2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_GOLD.png\" alt=\"ICON_GOLD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>金币。</li><li>回调<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/improvements/common/IMPROVEMENT_QUARRY.html\">采石场</a>在<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/technologies/ERA_MEDIEVAL/TECH_APPRENTICESHIP.html\">学徒</a>后+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li>回调<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/improvements/common/IMPROVEMENT_LUMBER_MILL.html\">伐木场</a>在<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/technologies/ERA_CLASSICAL/TECH_CONSTRUCTION.html\">建造</a>后+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/improvements/common/IMPROVEMENT_MINE.html\">矿山</a>在<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/technologies/ERA_CLASSICAL/TECH_ENGINEERING.html\">工程</a>后+1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"总督改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governors/Governors/GOVERNOR_THE_EDUCATOR.html\">平伽拉</a>：基础能力由15%<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值15%<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值回调至20%<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_SCIENCE.png\" alt=\"ICON_SCIENCE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>科技值20%<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_CULTURE.png\" alt=\"ICON_CULTURE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>文化值。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governors/Governors/GOVERNOR_THE_RESOURCE_MANAGER.html\">马格努斯</a>：盈余物流对内商的加成由2<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力回调至4<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物。</li><li><a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/governors/Governors/GOVERNOR_THE_MERCHANT.html\">瑞娜</a>：税务官改名为市舶榷务。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"城市政策改动","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li>回调<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/historic_moments/city_policy/PROJECT_CITY_POLICY_ENABLE_LABOR.html\">启用 徭役</a>：项目启用徭役和禁用徭役从1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力分别回调为5<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力和10<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力，移回启用徭役时-1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_AMENITIES.png\" alt=\"ICON_AMENITIES\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>宜居度。</li><li>移回<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/historic_moments/city_policy/PROJECT_CITY_POLICY_ENABLE_REVISION_ALMANAC.html\">启用 修编历书</a>。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""},{"text":"商路相关","type":"header"},{"text":"<ul><li>国内<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_TRADEROUTE.png\" alt=\"ICON_TRADEROUTE\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>贸易路线从目的地的<a href=\"../../../zh_Hans_CN/districts/common/DISTRICT_CITY_CENTER.html\">市中心</a>获得的加成由1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力回调为1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_FOOD.png\" alt=\"ICON_FOOD\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>食物1<img src=\"../../../icons/ICON_PRODUCTION.png\" alt=\"ICON_PRODUCTION\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-bottom:4px;width:22px;height:22px;\"/>生产力。</li></ul>","type":"body","title":""}],"language":"zh_Hans","title":"v1.2.9更新日志"}